WEBVTT

1
00:00:16,940 --> 00:00:18,660
Manager Fang had already said hello beforehand.

2
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:20,660
I'll take you to the third-level garden halfway up the mountain

3
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:22,500
We are the five medicine gardens of Yufeng

4
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:23,820
The first level is at the foot of the mountain

5
00:00:23,820 --> 00:00:25,460
The higher you go, the higher the grade.

6
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:26,780
Your position is free

7
00:00:26,780 --> 00:00:28,300
No one dares to mess around

8
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:29,460
Thank you, Brother Wang

9
00:00:29,460 --> 00:00:31,580
Then can we go to the high-end medicine garden to have a look?

10
00:00:31,580 --> 00:00:33,020
There is no obstruction in the garden

11
00:00:33,020 --> 00:00:34,660
A garden that can be climbed up four steps

12
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:36,100
If you follow the instructions, you will bite people

13
00:00:36,100 --> 00:00:37,660
They are all managed by the inner disciples.

14
00:00:37,660 --> 00:00:40,100
If you don't have the ability to save your life, don't go up there.

15
00:00:40,100 --> 00:00:44,050
This is the idiot who treated Hou San a few days ago

16
00:00:44,050 --> 00:00:45,170
Fuck Master Chu who lies down

17
00:00:45,170 --> 00:00:46,700
Keep your voice down

18
00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:48,220
Wang Zhi is all in his hands

19
00:00:48,340 --> 00:00:53,710
Let's not make trouble

20
00:00:53,710 --> 00:00:54,710
Senior Brother Chu

21
00:00:54,710 --> 00:00:56,310
The new person assigned by Manager Fang has arrived.

22
00:00:56,310 --> 00:00:57,310
You take care of it
